---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Infrastructure | Phil Burney for Commissioner"
  description="Phil Burney's platform on infrastructure for Rutherford County District 5."
>
  <section class="section platform-hero">
    <p class="tag">Platform</p>
    <h1>Infrastructure</h1>
    <p class="muted lead">
      Rutherford County's rapid growth is straining our roads, drainage, and public
      facilities. Phil will prioritize practical, well-planned infrastructure investments
      that keep up with demand and protect residents' quality of life.
    </p>
    <a href="/platform" class="btn btn-outline back-link">← All Platform Issues</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section platform-stack">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Roads &amp; Traffic</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Congestion in District 5 is getting worse every year. Phil will push for a
        county road plan that addresses bottlenecks, improves safety at dangerous
        intersections, and coordinates with NCDOT on state-route improvements.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Publish and maintain a county road priority list</li>
        <li>Require traffic impact studies before major developments are approved</li>
        <li>Advocate for state funding on District 5 corridors</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>Drainage &amp; Stormwater</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Flooding is a growing problem as impervious surfaces replace green space. Phil
        supports a proactive county stormwater program that protects homes and farmland
        from flood damage.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Audit drainage infrastructure across the district</li>
        <li>Require stormwater mitigation in new developments</li>
        <li>Fund culvert and drainage upgrades in flood-prone areas</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>Public Facilities</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        County buildings, parks, and public spaces need ongoing investment to remain
        safe and functional. Phil will champion a capital maintenance schedule so
        deferred repairs don't become costly emergencies.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Establish a rolling 5-year capital improvement plan</li>
        <li>Prioritize ADA accessibility in county facilities</li>
        <li>Improve county park amenities in underserved areas</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>Broadband &amp; Utilities</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Reliable internet access is essential infrastructure in 2026. Phil will work
        to close the digital divide in rural parts of District 5 and ensure utilities
        can support the county's growth.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Advocate for federal broadband expansion funding</li>
        <li>Partner with providers to extend service to unconnected areas</li>
        <li>Coordinate utility capacity planning with development approvals</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <h2>Help shape the agenda</h2>
      <p>Phil wants to hear about infrastructure problems in your neighborhood.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/donations" class="btn btn-primary">Support the Campaign</a>
        <a href="/platform" class="btn btn-outline-light">View All Issues</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .platform-hero {
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }

  .platform-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .back-link {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.1rem;
  }
</style>
